{"id": "19-1934-2-8", "zh": "11. 在能力与相宜义中用 eyya 等词尾", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1935-2-8", "zh": "在表示能力与相宜的意义时，动词词根之后加 eyya 等词尾。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1935-9-19", "zh": "阁下确实能烧钵——意思是阁下有能力，阁下适合。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1936-2-5", "zh": "12. 在推测义中可选用（eyya 等词尾）", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1937-2-10", "zh": "当推测之义可从语境领会，或由动词词根直接表达时，可选用 eyya 等词尾。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1937-11-28", "zh": "阁下或许能用腹中之火消化吞下的石头；我推测、我相信阁下能消化（paceyya），阁下将会消化（pacissati），阁下消化了（apaci）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1938-2-8", "zh": "9. 在询问、祈求、规定义中", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1939-2-6", "zh": "在询问等意义中，动词词根之后加 eyya 等词尾。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1940-2-9", "zh": "询问就是发问；对所愿之事的希冀与请求，这两者", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1941-2-13", "zh": "称为祈求；无论是否出于敬意而差使他人，称为规定。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1942-2-9", "zh": "询问：他该煮饭呢，还是煮菜？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1942-10-15", "zh": "祈求：但愿他能煮！", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1942-16-23", "zh": "规定：请阁下烧钵。（以上是 eyya 等词尾的用法。）", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1943-2-15", "zh": "10. tu、antu、hi、tha、mi、ma、taṃ、antaṃ、ssu、vho、e、āmase", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1944-2-7", "zh": "这些词尾在询问、祈求、规定义中加在动词词根之后。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1944-8-15", "zh": "表示祝愿：愿他快乐，愿他们快乐。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1945-2-7", "zh": "48. a 之后的 hi 脱落", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1946-2-8", "zh": "a 之后的 hi 可选脱落。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1946-9-16", "zh": "愿你快乐：bhava、bhavāhi；保留 hi 时，前面的元音变为长音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1946-17-29", "zh": "依“Eyyātha”等规则作 vho，愿你们快乐：bhavathavho、bhavatha。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "19-1946-30-37", "zh": "愿我快乐：bhavāmi；愿我们快乐：bhavāma。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1946-38-42", "zh": "后六种（反身语态）也同样：bhavataṃ、bhavantaṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1946-43-46", "zh": "bhavassu、bhavavho。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1946-47-49", "zh": "bhave、bhavāmase。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1946-50-55", "zh": "被动语态：愿由你来领受（anubhūyatu）、anubhūyantu 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1946-56-59", "zh": "无人称语态：bhūyatu、bhūyataṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1947-2-9", "zh": "命令：现在让天授煮饭吧（pacatu），pacantu 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1947-10-14", "zh": "被动语态：让饭由他来煮（paccatu）等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1947-15-20", "zh": "同样：让他去村子（gacchatu）等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1947-21-35", "zh": "依“Ū lasse”规则，la 变为 e 时：gametu、gamentu 等。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-1947-36-41", "zh": "替换为 ghamma 时：ghammatu、ghammantu 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1947-42-44", "zh": "被动语态：gacchīyatu 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1947-45-48", "zh": "同样：gamīyatu 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1948-2-10", "zh": "规定：la 脱落，脱落之后元音增强，例如：让这里有一座山（hotu）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1949-2-39", "zh": "邀请：尊者，请世尊接受这顿饭食（adhivāsetha）。这里词根 vas 依“curādito ṇī”加 ṇi，依“assā ṇānubandhe”变为 ā，又依“yuvaṇṇānameo paccaye”变为 e。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1949-40-61", "zh": "请阁下在这里坐下（nissīdatu）。词根 sad 依“jarasadānamīma vā”加 īma；因为带有标记 m，īma 加在末尾元音之后。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1950-2-10", "zh": "恳请：尊者，请世尊说法（desetu）。这里因为属于 cur 等类词根，与前例相同。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1951-2-9", "zh": "许可：婆娑婆，你问我问题吧；请阁下进来。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1951-10-14", "zh": "这里在 puccha 之后，hi 脱落。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1951-15-17", "zh": "同样：nisīda（请坐）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1952-2-23", "zh": "祈求就是请求。例如词根 dada，义为给予：请给我五座上好的村庄（dadāhi）；dā 之后的 la 变为 e 时：请给我一只眼睛（dehi）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1953-2-10", "zh": "时机已到：你编席子的时候到了，请阁下编席子吧。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1953-11-19", "zh": "这里依“tanāditvo”规则加 o。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1954-2-9", "zh": "tu 等、eyya 等与现在时词尾，用于现在与未来；", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "19-1955-2-7", "zh": "未来时词尾用于未来，parokkhā 等四种属于过去时。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "19-1956-2-14", "zh": "5,173. gam、yam、is、ās、dis 可选变为 cchaṅa", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1957-2-10", "zh": "在 nta、māna 与 ti 等词尾之前，这些词根可选变为 cchaṅa。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1957-11-18", "zh": "他去往天界：gacchati、gameti；gacchanti 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1957-19-22", "zh": "被动语态：gacchīyati、gamīyati 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1957-23-33", "zh": "yama 义为止息。parokkhā 与 anajjatanī 的形式，各处都应依照实际用例来配置。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1957-34-41", "zh": "前加 ni：niyacchati、niyamati；niyacchanti、niyamanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1957-42-56", "zh": "前加 saṃ：依“ye saṃssā”变为 ñña：saññamati、saññamanti。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1957-57-63", "zh": "被动语态：niyacchīyati、niyamīyati、niyammati，或 saññamīyati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1957-64-69", "zh": "同样：niyacchissati、saññamissati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1957-70-73", "zh": "niyacchi、saṃyami。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1957-74-77", "zh": "niyacchissa、saṃyamissa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1957-78-81", "zh": "niyaccheyya、saṃyameyya。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1957-82-85", "zh": "niyacchatu、saññamatu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1957-86-98", "zh": "isa 与 siṃsa 义为希求。他希求天界：icchati；icchanti 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1957-99-110", "zh": "依“Lahussupantassā”元音增强时：esati、esanti 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1957-111-122", "zh": "被动语态：icchīyati；依“vā kvacī”元音增强时：esīyati。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1957-123-127", "zh": "同化为前音时：issati、issate 等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1957-128-131", "zh": "icchissati、esissati 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1957-132-134", "zh": "icchi、esi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1957-135-137", "zh": "icchissa、esissa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1957-138-140", "zh": "iccheyya、eseyya。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1957-141-144", "zh": "icchatu、esatu 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1957-145-153", "zh": "āsa 义为坐。他坐在座位上：acchati 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1957-154-167", "zh": "依“Byañjane dīgharassā”变为短音。前加 upa 时，同样：upāsati。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1957-168-170", "zh": "acchissati、upāsissati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1957-171-173", "zh": "acchi、upāsi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1957-174-176", "zh": "acchissa、upāsissa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1957-177-179", "zh": "accheyya、upāseyya。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1957-180-183", "zh": "acchatu、upāsatu 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1957-184-193", "zh": "disa 义为看。dicchati、dicchanti 等，一切都与前面相同。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1957-194-205", "zh": "labha 义为获得。从这里往后，我们只讲有特殊之处的地方，完整的变化应依照前面所说的来理解。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1957-206-210", "zh": "labhati、labhanti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1957-211-216", "zh": "被动语态：kya 同化为前音等处理之后，得到 labbhati 等。", "confidence": 70}
